<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>what the heck!</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">22december, Shady Moon, Basco</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">what the heck!</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">70jvxPPtzRqQePjUwCoVqo</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">3 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What the heck! Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Brian</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: 22december]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, she got her hoodie tight like $not, swear to god she a baddie</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Got Saint Laurent up on her shoes, that bitch calling me daddy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I'm gon' count up her checks, and VVS on my neck</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Plus I done fucked up my deck, and I'm like, "Bro what the heck?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She got her hoodie tight like $not, swear to god she a baddie</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Got Saint Laurent up on her shoes, that bitch calling me daddy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I'm gon' count up her checks, and VVS on my neck</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Plus I done fucked up my deck, and I'm like, "Bro what the heck?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse: Shady MOON]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Tokyo drift on your bitch, she want fuck mе for my drip</p><p ttm:agent="v1">This ain't a skit, boy you whipped, caught me on her pussy lips</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don't givе a fuck, she said that I'm toxic I got no luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You want static, grab the K, I'ma show them boys what's up</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I'm like ayy, that bitch hella fine, go tell her hey</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What's up today, that bitch from the bay</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I hit the strip she wanna stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Told her hop up in the Benz, she said, "okay"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What's the deal, I'ma slide her through today</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She so toxic, she all about me, and the money</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She getting mad under my comments, bitches calling me honey</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I told her I can't stop it so I laugh 'cause it's funny</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I don't care 'bout these bitches, 'cause my girl my lil' bunny</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She got that dark hair, bangs down, looking like a vampire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Posted with the strap, my bitch she stepping with that strap fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Boss lil' bitch around me, fuck these bum hoes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Thots in my mansions, I gotta go bro, 'cause she got that[Chorus: 22December]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, she got her hoodie tight like $not, swear to god she a baddie</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Got Saint Laurent up on her shoes, that bitch calling me daddy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I'm gon' count up her checks, and VVS on my neck</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Plus I done fucked up my deck, and I'm like "Bro what the heck?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She got her hoodie tight like $not, swear to god she a baddie</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Got Saint Laurent up on her shoes, that bitch calling me daddy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I'm gon' count up her checks, and VVS on my neck</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Plus I done fucked up my deck, and I'm like "Bro what the heck?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse: Basco]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like what the fuck, she all up on my neck</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She got them thick thighs, brown eyes, she ain't living state side</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lil' bitch, I just hit on bases, run them base line</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Okay, don't know where you at bitch, I can't find you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Okay, yuh, swerving up in a Coupe, ayy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pop a molly or two, ayy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Damned to call you my boo, okay</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What you tryna go do?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm home, I'm tryna roll with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm going hanging out with my crew</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Run around fast, maybe gon' zoom</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like what the fuck, these bitches are the same no need of love, ayy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Bitch you ain't the one, see you ain't no fucking dub, ayy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You just on some lame shit, all these hoes they basic</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Get you off my mind, when I'm gone, when I'm wasted</p></div></body></tt>